<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Eagle USA started neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Eagle USA started neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it started coverage of Eagle USA Airfreight Inc with a neutral rating on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares were flat at 27-1/4.</p>
</text>
